    "created_at": "2020-03-23T10:07:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-23T10:07:45Z",
    "body": "If the owner has COEP set, the worker should have COEP set. If the owner does not COEP set, the worker may have COEP set.\r\n\r\nAnd the worker should set it explicitly, since we don't want to create too many subtle differences between dedicated/shared/service workers.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
